{"id":"n17207-2-3","stage":1,"title":"그곳 · 那儿","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n17207-2-3-1","ko":"약속 장소는 잊지 않았지?","zh":"约会地点你没忘吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"약속","meaning":"约定，约好，承诺","explanation":"약속：约定，约好，承诺。","readings":[{"term":"약속","audio":"/audio/a39ee87db456831ef069.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36695","senseId":"1","lemma":"약속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"약속","audio":"/audio/a39ee87db456831ef069.mp3"}},{"text":"장소는","meaning":"场所，地点","explanation":"장소：场所，地点；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"장소","audio":"/audio/61eaecc09cb7e53dbc6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30185","senseId":"1","lemma":"장소","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"장소는","audio":"/audio/cc6c1eee574864c83de7.mp3"}},{"text":"잊지","meaning":"忘，忘记","explanation":"잊다：忘，忘记；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"잊다","audio":"/audio/b0566314f635fe32e273.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70067","senseId":"2","lemma":"잊다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잊지","audio":"/audio/76c6eab6f8a0fbfc7ef5.mp3"}},{"text":"않았지?","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71581","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않았지","audio":"/audio/41a50fb3f47aa5e8c13f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a39ee87db456831e","term":"약속","zh":"约定，约好，承诺","audio":"/audio/a39ee87db456831ef069.mp3","entryId":"36695","definition":"事先决定与他人一起做某事；或指那样定下的内容。","pronunciation":["약쏙"]},{"id":"61eaecc09cb7e53d","term":"장소","zh":"场所，地点","audio":"/audio/61eaecc09cb7e53dbc6e.mp3","entryId":"30185","definition":"某事发生的地方；或指进行某事的地方。","pronunciation":["장소"]},{"id":"b0566314f635fe32","term":"잊다","zh":"忘，忘记","audio":"/audio/b0566314f635fe32e273.mp3","entryId":"70067","definition":"一下子想不起要记住的事情。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71581","definition":"用于否定前文所指的行为。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/e98849a3372f2d8d56b3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n17207-2-3-2","ko":"네, 세 시까지 그곳으로 바로 가겠습니다.","zh":"是的，我会在三点前直接去那里。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"세","meaning":"三","explanation":"세：三。","readings":[{"term":"세","audio":"/audio/1bcc05bddb3c9e8c0bec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17194","senseId":"1","lemma":"세","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"세","audio":"/audio/1bcc05bddb3c9e8c0bec.mp3"}},{"text":"시까지","meaning":"点，点钟","explanation":"시：点，点钟；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。","readings":[{"term":"시","audio":"/audio/bfa42cf6a12e91233038.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65108","senseId":"1","lemma":"시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시까지","audio":"/audio/972d301887c6b402fd38.mp3"}},{"text":"그곳으로","meaning":"那儿，那里","explanation":"그곳：那儿，那里；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"그곳","audio":"/audio/093e0b955cac928053f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17207","senseId":"2","lemma":"그곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그곳으로","audio":"/audio/7fba7755f9faea260523.mp3"}},{"text":"바로","meaning":"立即，立刻","explanation":"바로：立即，立刻。","readings":[{"term":"바로","audio":"/audio/a441b444c56119c0f154.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64744","senseId":"5","lemma":"바로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바로","audio":"/audio/a441b444c56119c0f154.mp3"}},{"text":"가겠습니다.","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":